# Core Rules

**Entry:** [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) · **Standards:** [RULES.md](../../RULES.md) §3.2 · **Deep dive:** [docs/ai/05-core.md](../../docs/ai/05-core.md)

## Scope

`lib/core/` — shared infrastructure, not feature domain or engine rendering.

**User messages:** `lib/core/feedback/app_messenger.dart` — not `SnackBar`.

## DI

Register in `lib/core/utils/service_locator.dart` via `setupServiceLocator()`.

- **Singletons:** `Dio`, `AuthRepo`, `ProductRepo`, `TokenCubit`, `VariantRepository`
- **Factories:** product cubits (new per provider)

Use `getIt<T>()`. Verify registrations before adding types.

## Network

- Base URL + tenant from `MobileAppConfig.app`
- `AuthInterceptor` on `Dio` for authenticated routes
- Public catalog: `/api/v1/public/*` — **no** auth header

## Routing

`AppRouter.setupRouter` — config routes → `VariantScreen`. Tab shell: `TabShellWidget`.

## In-app user messages (`AppMessenger`)

- **Path:** `lib/core/feedback/app_messenger.dart`
- **Use for:** validation errors, auth/API feedback, success/info toasts (not Firebase push)
- **Must:** top overlay via root `Overlay`; `AppMessageKind` (error / success / info / warning); theme from `EngineTheme` or `Theme.of(context)`
- **Must not:** `ScaffoldMessenger.showSnackBar` / bottom `SnackBar`; calls from engine renderers
- **Auth wiring:** `_AuthRequestHost` in `variant_screen.dart` replaces legacy SnackBars
- **List/grid errors:** stay in `request_ui_state` / `dataContext` unless task says otherwise
- Full spec: [RULES.md §3.10](../../RULES.md#310-in-app-user-messages-appmessenger), [docs/ai/05-core.md](../../docs/ai/05-core.md#in-app-user-messages-appmessenger)

## Must not

- Parse page JSON or map component `type` here
- Add product-specific API paths (belongs in `lib/features/product/`)
- Register renderers or change `ScreenRenderer`

## Auth session

`TokenCubit`, `AuthRedirect`, `AuthTokenStorage` — session lifecycle (feature repos own OTP HTTP).
